    <div class="grid2" style="margin-top: 16px;">
      <div class="card"><h3>Encrypted DNS</h3><p>Use DoH, DoT, or DoQ depending on your device, router, browser, or network design.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Protective filtering</h3><p>Filtered resolver mode blocks known risky destinations using curated blocklists.</p></div>
