    <div class="card" style="margin-top: 16px;">
      <p>AEGIS PDNS is powered by the AEGIS-DNS list pipeline. The public repo publishes list manifests, chunk metadata, SHA-256 hashes, build timing, and release archives.</p>
      <p>This does not mean every detection decision is perfect. It means the filtering base is visible enough to audit, test, and improve.</p>
